{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "國人", "id": "國人"}, {"form": "大夫", "id": "大夫"}, {"form": "左右", "id": "左右"}, {"form": "有司", "id": "有司"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.9789251552376097, "source": "先", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 3.672072335797555, "source": "義", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 3.672072335797555, "source": "義", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 3.1612467120315646, "source": "義", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.9789251552376097, "source": "義", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "下", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 1.8803128665695001, "source": "下", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 2.5734600471294455, "source": "下", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 0.5810298824392391, "source": "上", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "上", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.5734600471294455, "source": "上", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 2.5734600471294455, "source": "大夫", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.7557816039234, "source": "舍", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 2.5734600471294455, "source": "國人", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 3.959754408249336, "source": "殘", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 1.2741770629991844, "source": "殘", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "出", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.7557816039234, "source": "出", "target": "有司"}, {"weight": 2.06